  user_input {
    user_response: "Build a complete production-ready Flutter mobile application called \"MediReminder AI\" for Android and iOS.\n\nTech Stack:\n- Flutter\n- Riverpod State Management\n- Clean Architecture\n- REST API Integration\n- Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM)\n- Material 3 UI\n- Responsive Design\n\nBackend:\n- Node.js + Express.js\n- PostgreSQL (Supabase)\n- Supabase Storage\n- Gemini AI API\n- PayU Payment Gateway\n- Firebase Cloud Messaging\n\nImportant:\nThis mobile application must not use mock data.\n\nAll data must come from REST APIs.\n\nThe app must be fully connected with an Admin Dashboard through a shared backend and database.\n\nAny changes made by Admin should automatically reflect inside the mobile application.\n\nExamples:\n- If Admin changes pricing, updated pricing appears in app.\n- If Admin blocks a user, user loses access immediately.\n- If Admin sends notifications, users receive them instantly.\n- If Admin enables maintenance mode, app displays maintenance screen.\n\nCore Purpose:\n\nUsers can:\n\n1. Upload doctor prescriptions.\n2. Extract medicine information using OCR and AI.\n3. Verify extracted medicines.\n4. Configure reminders.\n5. Purchase reminder duration.\n6. Receive notifications.\n7. Upgrade to Pro.\n8. Add family members.\n9. Track medicine compliance.\n\nPrescription Upload:\n\nSupport:\n\n- Camera\n- Gallery\n- PDF Upload\n\nFormats:\n\n- JPG\n- PNG\n- PDF\n\nOCR Processing:\n\nExtract:\n\n- Medicine Name\n- Dosage\n- Frequency\n- Duration\n- Morning\n- Afternoon\n- Evening\n- Night\n- Before Food\n- After Food\n- Instructions\n\nVerification Screen:\n\nDisplay extracted medicines.\n\nAllow:\n\n- Edit\n- Delete\n- Add New Medicine\n- Modify Reminder Times\n\nDisplay Warning:\n\n\"Please verify medicine details with your doctor or pharmacist before proceeding.\"\n\nManual Medicine Entry:\n\nAllow:\n\n- Medicine Name\n- Dosage\n- Frequency\n- Duration\n- Reminder Type\n\nReminder System:\n\nSupport:\n\n- Morning\n- Afternoon\n- Evening\n- Night\n- Hourly\n- Before Food\n- After Food\n- Before Sleep\n- Custom Reminder\n\nNotification Actions:\n\n- Taken\n- Skip\n- Snooze\n\nMedicine Tracking:\n\nTrack:\n\n- Taken\n- Missed\n- Delayed\n\nDashboard:\n\nDisplay:\n\n- Active Medicines\n- Today\'s Medicines\n- Upcoming Doses\n- Compliance Percentage\n- Days Remaining\n\nCalendar:\n\nDisplay:\n\n- Daily View\n- Weekly View\n- Monthly View\n\nAuthentication:\n\n- OTP Login\n- Google Login\n- Apple Login\n\nProfile:\n\n- Name\n- Age\n- Gender\n- Emergency Contact\n\nPayment System:\n\nUse PayU.\n\nSupport:\n\n- UPI\n- Cards\n- Net Banking\n\nPricing:\n\nPay Per Day Model.\n\nExamples:\n\n5 Days\n10 Days\n15 Days\n30 Days\n60 Days\nCustom Days\n\nFormula:\n\nTotal Cost = Price Per Day \303\227 Number of Days\n\nPro Features:\n\n- Custom Voice Reminder\n- WhatsApp Reminder\n- Family WhatsApp Alerts\n- Family Monitoring Dashboard\n\nAI Features:\n\n- OCR Analysis\n- Medicine Extraction\n- Dosage Detection\n- Duplicate Medicine Detection\n- Medicine Interaction Warnings\n- Reminder Suggestions\n\nSettings:\n\n- Dark Mode\n- Notification Settings\n- Language Selection\n\nAPI Integration:\n\nCreate complete API layer.\n\nImplement:\n\n- Authentication APIs\n- Medicine APIs\n- Reminder APIs\n- Payment APIs\n- Notification APIs\n- Profile APIs\n\nGenerate:\n\n- Complete Flutter Project Structure\n- Clean Architecture\n- Models\n- Repositories\n- Services\n- Providers\n- Screens\n- Components\n- API Integration Layer\n- Error Handling\n- Loading States\n- Production Ready Source Code\n\nBackend Base URL:\n\nhttps://api.medireminder.com\n\nDo not create a demo app.\n\nCreate a scalable startup-ready production application."
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Build an Android app\"\nicon: \"android_color\"\n---\n\n"
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      text: "Build a complete production-ready Flutter mobile application called \"MediReminder AI\" for Android and iOS.\n\nTech Stack:\n- Flutter\n- Riverpod State Management\n- Clean Architecture\n- REST API Integration\n- Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM)\n- Material 3 UI\n- Responsive Design\n\nBackend:\n- Node.js + Express.js\n- PostgreSQL (Supabase)\n- Supabase Storage\n- Gemini AI API\n- PayU Payment Gateway\n- Firebase Cloud Messaging\n\nImportant:\nThis mobile application must not use mock data.\n\nAll data must come from REST APIs.\n\nThe app must be fully connected with an Admin Dashboard through a shared backend and database.\n\nAny changes made by Admin should automatically reflect inside the mobile application.\n\nExamples:\n- If Admin changes pricing, updated pricing appears in app.\n- If Admin blocks a user, user loses access immediately.\n- If Admin sends notifications, users receive them instantly.\n- If Admin enables maintenance mode, app displays maintenance screen.\n\nCore Purpose:\n\nUsers can:\n\n1. Upload doctor prescriptions.\n2. Extract medicine information using OCR and AI.\n3. Verify extracted medicines.\n4. Configure reminders.\n5. Purchase reminder duration.\n6. Receive notifications.\n7. Upgrade to Pro.\n8. Add family members.\n9. Track medicine compliance.\n\nPrescription Upload:\n\nSupport:\n\n- Camera\n- Gallery\n- PDF Upload\n\nFormats:\n\n- JPG\n- PNG\n- PDF\n\nOCR Processing:\n\nExtract:\n\n- Medicine Name\n- Dosage\n- Frequency\n- Duration\n- Morning\n- Afternoon\n- Evening\n- Night\n- Before Food\n- After Food\n- Instructions\n\nVerification Screen:\n\nDisplay extracted medicines.\n\nAllow:\n\n- Edit\n- Delete\n- Add New Medicine\n- Modify Reminder Times\n\nDisplay Warning:\n\n\"Please verify medicine details with your doctor or pharmacist before proceeding.\"\n\nManual Medicine Entry:\n\nAllow:\n\n- Medicine Name\n- Dosage\n- Frequency\n- Duration\n- Reminder Type\n\nReminder System:\n\nSupport:\n\n- Morning\n- Afternoon\n- Evening\n- Night\n- Hourly\n- Before Food\n- After Food\n- Before Sleep\n- Custom Reminder\n\nNotification Actions:\n\n- Taken\n- Skip\n- Snooze\n\nMedicine Tracking:\n\nTrack:\n\n- Taken\n- Missed\n- Delayed\n\nDashboard:\n\nDisplay:\n\n- Active Medicines\n- Today\'s Medicines\n- Upcoming Doses\n- Compliance Percentage\n- Days Remaining\n\nCalendar:\n\nDisplay:\n\n- Daily View\n- Weekly View\n- Monthly View\n\nAuthentication:\n\n- OTP Login\n- Google Login\n- Apple Login\n\nProfile:\n\n- Name\n- Age\n- Gender\n- Emergency Contact\n\nPayment System:\n\nUse PayU.\n\nSupport:\n\n- UPI\n- Cards\n- Net Banking\n\nPricing:\n\nPay Per Day Model.\n\nExamples:\n\n5 Days\n10 Days\n15 Days\n30 Days\n60 Days\nCustom Days\n\nFormula:\n\nTotal Cost = Price Per Day \303\227 Number of Days\n\nPro Features:\n\n- Custom Voice Reminder\n- WhatsApp Reminder\n- Family WhatsApp Alerts\n- Family Monitoring Dashboard\n\nAI Features:\n\n- OCR Analysis\n- Medicine Extraction\n- Dosage Detection\n- Duplicate Medicine Detection\n- Medicine Interaction Warnings\n- Reminder Suggestions\n\nSettings:\n\n- Dark Mode\n- Notification Settings\n- Language Selection\n\nAPI Integration:\n\nCreate complete API layer.\n\nImplement:\n\n- Authentication APIs\n- Medicine APIs\n- Reminder APIs\n- Payment APIs\n- Notification APIs\n- Profile APIs\n\nGenerate:\n\n- Complete Flutter Project Structure\n- Clean Architecture\n- Models\n- Repositories\n- Services\n- Providers\n- Screens\n- Components\n- API Integration Layer\n- Error Handling\n- Loading States\n- Production Ready Source Code\n\nBackend Base URL:\n\nhttps://api.medireminder.com\n\nDo not create a demo app.\n\nCreate a scalable startup-ready production application."
    }
  }
}
